@startuml
state UnregisteredState
state RegisteringState
state RegisteredState
state InvalidLocationState
state ValidLocationState
state WeatherSelectionState
state WeatherInformationState
state AdditionalDetailsState
state LoggedOutState

[*] -> UnregisteredState: UserRegistrationEvent
UnregisteredState -->|valid| RegisteringState: UserRegistrationEvent
RegisteringState -->|success| RegisteredState
RegisteringState -->|failure| UnregisteredState
RegisteredState -->|LogoutEvent| LoggedOutState

ValidLocationState -->|LocationValidationEvent| WeatherSelectionState
InvalidLocationState --> InvalidLocationState
WeatherSelectionState --> WeatherInformationState: WeatherInformationRequestEvent
WeatherInformationState -->+ AdditionalDetailsState
LoggedOutState --> UnregisteredState
@enduml
